06-04T10:37:19+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T10:53:46+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/03-vxlan-evpn/setup/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/03-vxlan-evpn/setup/", "title": "Overlay \u8a2d\u5b9a", "content_html": "Overlay \u8a2d\u5b9a \u2014 Overlay \u306e\u8a2d\u5b9a\u306f\u3001\u6700\u521d\u306b\u300cL2 VLAN-VNI \u3092\u4f5c\u308b\u306e\u304b\u300d\u300cVNET route \u3092\u4f5c\u308b\u306e\u304b\u300d\u300cEVPN \u306e NVO \u3092\u4f5c\u308b\u306e\u304b\u300d\u3092\u6c7a\u3081\u308b\u3068\u6574\u7406\u3067\u304d\u308b\u3002\u3069\u306e\u5834\u5408\u3082\u3001VTEP \u3068\u306a\u308b VXLAN tunnel \u304c\u5148\u306b\u5fc5\u8981\u3068\u306a\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/03-vxlan-evpn/setup.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T10:37:19+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T10:53:46+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/08-qos-buffer/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/08-qos-buffer/", "title": "QoS / Buffer / PFC / Watermark", "content_html": "QoS / Buffer / PFC / Watermark \u2014 \u3053\u306e\u7ae0\u306f\u3001SONiC \u306e\u300cASIC \u306e\u30d0\u30c3\u30d5\u30a1\u3092\u3069\u3046\u5206\u3051\u308b\u304b\u300d\u300c\u30ad\u30e5\u30fc\u3092\u3069\u306e\u9806\u3067\u51fa\u3059\u304b\u300d\u300c\u6df7\u3093\u3060\u3089\u8ab0\u306b\u6b62\u307e\u3063\u3066\u3082\u3089\u3046\u304b\u300d\u300c\u6df7\u307f\u5177\u5408\u3092\u3069\u3046\u6e2c\u308b\u304b\u300d\u3092\u3001\u8aad\u307f\u624b\u306e\u8cea\u554f\u9806\u306b\u307e\u3068\u3081\u76f4\u3057\u305f\u3082\u306e\u3067\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/08-qos-buffer/index.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T10:37:19+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T01:34:48+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/08-qos-buffer/advanced/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/08-qos-buffer/advanced/", "title": "QoS / Buffer \u306e\u767a\u5c55\u30c8\u30d4\u30c3\u30af", "content_html": "QoS / Buffer / PFC \u306e\u57fa\u672c\uff08scheduler\u3001queue map\u3001PG\u3001watermark\uff09\u3092\u62bc\u3055\u3048\u305f\u5f8c\u306e\u767a\u5c55\u9818\u57df\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3001\u52d5\u7684 buffer model \u306e alpha \u8a2d\u5b9a\u3001PFC watchdog \u306e\u30c1\u30e5\u30fc\u30cb\u30f3\u30b0\u3001Asymmetric PFC\u3001headroom pool \u8a2d\u8a08\u3001WRED/ECN \u306e\u7d30\u5206\u5316\u3092\u6574\u7406\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/08-qos-buffer/advanced.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T10:37:19+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T07:38:41+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/gnoi-gnsi/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/gnoi-gnsi/", "title": "gNOI / gNSI", "content_html": "gNOI / gNSI \u2014 gNOI (gRPC Network Operations Interface) \u306f\u3001\u8a2d\u5b9a\u8aad\u307f\u66f8\u304d (gNMI) \u306e\u96a3\u3067 reboot / OS install / file transfer / factory reset / healthz \u3068\u3044\u3063\u305f\u64cd\u4f5c RPC \u3092\u62c5\u5f53\u3057\u3001gNSI (gRPC Network Security Interface) \u304c\u8a3c\u660e\u66f8\u914d\u5e03\u30fb\u8a8d\u53ef\u30fbattestation \u3092\u62c5\u3046\u3002SONiC \u3067\u306f telemetry container \u5185\u306e gNMI server \u306b\u540c\u5c45\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/10-gnmi-openconfig/gnoi-gnsi.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T10:37:19+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T01:29:20+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design-concepts/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design-concepts/", "title": "SmartSwitch HA HAMgrD \u6982\u5ff5\uff08actor model \u3068 vDPU \u62bd\u8c61\uff09", "content_html": "HAMgrD \u306e\u6982\u5ff5\u3002NPU \u5074 actor model\u3001vDPU \u62bd\u8c61\u3001HA Set / HA Scope \u306e\u5f79\u5272\u3001DPU-Driven / Switch-Driven mode \u306e\u9055\u3044\u3092\u6574\u7406\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design-concepts.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-04T10:11:30+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T20:40:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}]}